[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0249","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0249.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0279","title":"Be BeOS IP报文长度字段处理拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Be BeOS 4.0/4.5/5.0 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的畸形 IP 数据包触发该漏洞，其中数据包长度字段值小于实际头部长度，导致系统无法正确处理而崩溃。该漏洞影响 BeOS 4.0、4.5 及 5.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。目前官方已停止支持，建议用户迁移至其他操作系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0279"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-07T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:23Z","remediation":"BeOS 已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议在网络边界防火墙启用非法分片包过滤规则，丢弃 IP 首部长度字段与载荷长度不一致的异常数据包。同时在受影响的 BeOS 主机上禁用不必要的网络服务，并限制仅允许受信任内网段访问。长远建议迁移至仍受支持的操作系统平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0029.html","http://bebugs.be.com/devbugs/detail.php3?oid=2505312","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1100","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19841","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0279.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0279","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0279.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0279.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rf4g-4vxr-q8px/GHSA-rf4g-4vxr-q8px.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0279.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--712755d6-06ba-4e6a-ad3a-52dd3b3274dd.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0249.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0260","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0260.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0300","title":"Symantec pcAnywhere 弱加密漏洞","description":"Symantec pcAnywhere 9.x 默认使用弱加密算法对网络通信进行加密，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过嗅探网络流量捕获加密数据包，并利用弱加密的缺陷解密数据包内容，从而窃取 pcAnywhere 或 NT 域账户的明文凭据。该漏洞影响 pcAnywhere 9.0 及 9.x 系列版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重，攻击者获取凭据后可进一步控制目标系统。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0300"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-06T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:25Z","remediation":"升级到 Symantec pcAnywhere 12.5 或更高版本，启用强制 256 位 AES 加密。如无法升级，在连接设置中禁用默认弱加密并启用 SSL 加密。同时在防火墙层面限制仅允许受信 IP 访问 5631/TCP 和 5632/UDP 端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1093","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000406030958.23902.qmail%40securityfocus.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19836","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0300.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0300","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0300.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0300.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fvrm-4gj8-jr73/GHSA-fvrm-4gj8-jr73.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0300.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0260.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0292","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0292.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0301","title":"Ipswitch IMail AUTH CRAM-MD5 命令拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ipswitch IMail 服务器 6.02 及更早版本在处理 AUTH CRAM-MD5 认证命令时存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标服务器的 143 端口发送特制的 AUTH CRAM-MD5 请求，由于服务器对挑战响应的 CRLF 结束符处理不当，导致服务进程锁定并停止响应，正常用户无法访问邮件服务。该漏洞 CVSS v2 评分 5.0，攻击复杂度低且无需任何权限。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0301"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"2000-04-06T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 Ipswitch IMail 至 6.03 或更高版本，该版本已修复 CRAM-MD5 认证处理中缺少 CRLF 结束符导致的锁定问题。如无法立即升级，可在服务器上禁用 CRAM-MD5 认证方式，强制客户端使用 LOGIN 认证；同时在 Eudora 客户端中设置 SmtpAuthBanished=CRAM-MD5 以绕过该认证方法。若服务已锁定，需重启 IMail 服务进程恢复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=95505800117143&w=2","http://support.ipswitch.com/kb/IM-20000208-DM02.htm","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1094"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0292.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0227","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0227.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0251","title":"HP-UX VirtualVault 多别名 IP 接口信息泄露漏洞","description":"HP-UX 11.04 VirtualVault (VVOS) 存在信息泄露漏洞。当网络接口配置了多个别名 IP 地址时，系统会将本应发送给受信任虚拟服务器的数据错误地路由至非特权进程，导致敏感信息泄露。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用该漏洞，但需要目标系统存在特定网络配置环境。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0251"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"2000-04-06T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 HP 针对 VirtualVault VVOS 发布的安全补丁（HP Security Bulletin HPSBUX0004-112），升级至修复后的 HP-UX 11.04 VVOS 版本。如无法立即修补，应避免在 VirtualVault 接口上配置多个别名 IP 地址，并将非必要的未授权进程从该网络接口上移除，以降低信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0021.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1090"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0227.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0230","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0230.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0255","title":"Nbase-Xyplex EdgeBlaster 路由器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Nbase-Xyplex EdgeBlaster 路由器中存在拒绝服务漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送针对 FormMail CGI 程序的扫描探测请求，触发设备处理异常，导致路由器服务崩溃或无法正常响应，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Nbase-Xyplex EdgeBlaster 系列路由器，CVSS v2 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0255"],"sources":["cve","nvd"],"published":"2000-04-05T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"Nbase-Xyplex EdgeBlaster 路由器已停产且厂商已被收购，不再提供官方固件更新。建议用户：1）禁用路由器 Web 管理界面中不必要的 CGI 功能模块；2）配置访问控制列表（ACL），仅允许可信 IP 地址访问管理端口；3）使用防火墙规则拦截对 FormMail CGI 路径的外部扫描请求；4）将设备替换为仍在厂商支持周期内的新一代路由器产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0022.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1091"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0230.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0230.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0259","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0259.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0299","title":"Apple WebObjects Developer 4.5 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Apple WebObjects Developer 4.5 中的 WebObjects.exe 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送包含超长 HTTP 头（如 Accept 字段）的恶意请求触发该漏洞，导致 WebObjects 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响安装于 Windows NT 4.0 + IIS 4.0 平台上的 WebObjects Developer 4.5 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0299"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:25Z","remediation":"升级 Apple WebObjects 至 4.5 以上安全版本，或迁移至受支持的 WebObjects 5.x 版本。如无法升级，在 IIS 中限制 HTTP 请求头长度，或禁用 WebObjects CGI 适配器以消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0020.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20379","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0299.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0299","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0299.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0299.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-6fqg-f27x-w5jj/GHSA-6fqg-f27x-w5jj.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0299.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001264.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/CVE-Easy-List/blob/1e58254e5bdaf937b4bd41c6a50d0d633bef0eb7/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0259.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0259.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0259.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0485","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0485.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0634","title":"Stalker CommuniGate Pro 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Stalker CommuniGate Pro 3.2.5 及更早版本的 Web 管理界面存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者通过在 URL 中注入 ../ 序列可绕过路径限制，读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，攻击者可通过 HTTP 请求访问 /../../etc/passwd 等路径获取敏感信息，可能导致系统配置泄露或进一步攻击。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。目前已有公开的 ExploitDB 利用代码（ID: 20091）。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0634"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:09Z","remediation":"升级 CommuniGate Pro 至 3.2.6 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Web 管理接口的路径遍历漏洞。如无法立即升级，在防火墙层面限制对 TCP 8010 端口的访问，仅允许受信任的管理 IP 连接；同时避免以 root 身份运行 CommuniGate Pro 服务，降低文件被读取后的影响范围。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0223.html","http://www.osvdb.org/5774","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1493","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5105","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20091","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8a32d285d75465c2c539e92c7500793aa7910652/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0634.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0634","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/56ecbe5708e7172ccdeffde501e0321bbd31bea6/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0634.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/86ec648b067e7f3c439a59ccb9e6e448f07cc2d1/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0634.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ba518c3d2e41cb46015251f8c5b067b05ea0ba59/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-69fh-f7xf-67w9/GHSA-69fh-f7xf-67w9.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2000-0634.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0634.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2000.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0485.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0287","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0287.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0297","title":"Allaire Forums 访问限制绕过漏洞","description":"Allaire Forums 2.0.5 存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 rightAccessAllForums 或 rightModerateAllForums 变量提交特制请求，绕过安全会议（secure conferences）的访问限制，获取未授权的论坛管理权限。该漏洞影响 Allaire Forums 2.0.5 版本，CVSS 评分 6.4，危害等级中危。厂商已发布修复建议，建议用户升级至最新版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.4,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0297"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:25Z","remediation":"请升级 Allaire Forums 至 2.0.6 或更高版本（已安装 ASB00-08 安全公告对应补丁）。在升级前，临时缓解措施为：在 Web 服务器或反向代理层限制对 Forums 管理接口的访问，移除或严格校验 rightAccessAllForums 和 rightModerateAllForums 变量的输入。由于该产品已停止维护数十年，建议考虑迁移至仍在安全更新的替代论坛系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1270","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1085","http://www2.allaire.com/handlers/index.cfm?ID=15099&Method=Full","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0297.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve