\"，并禁止从外部文本文件自动加载执行 XLM 宏。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1272","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1087","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-022","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fbc52696b7594c66d398b40fcc0dc269121d7362/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0277.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0277","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0277.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6af0515548db3ee9e7e86d58b079762631fa8897/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0277.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j2mj-gpqp-ph4f/GHSA-j2mj-gpqp-ph4f.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cwe_details/cwe_details_600_700.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0277.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001260.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--acc5c563-9029-46a4-b95f-87d160f3d3e6.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0262.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0251","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0251.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0280","title":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 6/7 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"RealNetworks RealPlayer 6/7 版本存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送包含超长 Location URL 的恶意链接，当用户点击该链接时触发缓冲区溢出，导致 RealPlayer 客户端崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 RealPlayer 6 和 7 版本，攻击条件简单，无需身份认证，但 CVSS 评分仅 2.6，危害等级低。","severity":"LOW","score":2.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0280"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-04-03T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:23Z","remediation":"建议立即将 RealNetworks RealPlayer 升级至 8.0 及以上版本，该漏洞在后续版本中已被修复。如无法升级，可考虑卸载 RealPlayer 并改用其他播放器作为临时缓解措施。由于该版本已停止安全支持，建议彻底移除该软件以避免其他已知漏洞风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0018.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1088","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19834","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/21e8713bd16ad152d6b946e7bfcd11df673c4829/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0280.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0280","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0280.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0280.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vww3-jfqj-592j/GHSA-vww3-jfqj-592j.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0280.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152300_152400.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_0.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--0a6cb3c3-0f7e-4531-b9f0-ed2f524b9454.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0251.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0251.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0251.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0286","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0286.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0296","title":"fcheck 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"fcheck 是一款用于文件完整性检查的工具，其处理文件名时存在安全缺陷，未对用户可控的文件名中的 shell 元字符（如反引号、分号、管道符等）进行有效过滤和转义。本地攻击者可通过创建含有恶意 shell 元字符的特制文件名，诱使 fcheck 在处理文件时将其传递给 shell 执行，从而以 fcheck 运行权限执行任意命令，实现本地权限提升。该漏洞需要攻击者拥有本地系统访问权限并能够在受影响目录中创建文件才能利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0296"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:25Z","remediation":"升级 fcheck 至 2.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复文件名 shell 元字符转义问题；若无法升级，建议在 fcheck 源码中调用系统命令前对文件名使用 escapeshellarg() 或等价的 POSIX shell 转义函数处理所有文件名字段。临时缓解措施：限制被监控目录的写入权限，确保不可信用户无法在 fcheck 扫描路径下创建文件，同时考虑迁移至 AIDE、Tripwire 或 Samhain 等仍在维护的文件完整性检查工具。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/current/0011.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1086","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0296.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0296.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0296","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/475f53ac063af305fc146a443cce993188109d56/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0296.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0296.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j27w-32qp-vhcc/GHSA-j27w-32qp-vhcc.json","https://github.com/briandfoy/cpan-security-advisory/blob/2089ff7201b44e5e462742a5baaa080ba003d257/TO_DO","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0296.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d2ea44a0-156c-4a23-889d-839d003bcfcf.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0286.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0279","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0279.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0290","title":"Webstar HTTP Server 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"WebStar HTTP 服务器存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者无需任何身份认证，通过向目标服务器发送超长 GET 请求即可触发该漏洞，导致服务器进程崩溃并停止响应正常请求，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 StarNine WebStar HTTP Server 多个版本，CVSS v2.0 评分 5.0，危害等级中等，利用难度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0290"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:24Z","remediation":"升级 WebSTAR HTTP Server 至 4.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复长 GET 请求导致的缓冲区溢出问题。由于 WebSTAR 已停止维护，建议迁移至 Apache HTTP Server、Nginx 等现代 Web 服务器。如在迁移前需缓解风险，可在网络层部署 IDS/IPS 拦截超长 URI 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-04/0005.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1822","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/4792","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/5c4b2ba2a59a96457ab4b8ea4ee82efc5782bb1d/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0290.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0290","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0290.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/03de0f4bc3d6ed449f7108b4761b99fb0c8c56d7/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0290.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-267g-j5c9-f8p4/GHSA-267g-j5c9-f8p4.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/5b92f5917a4a825187ccaac594f43456a77ea8f3/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0290.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_dos.txt","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0279.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0212","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0212.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0234","title":"Cobalt RaQ 2.0/3.0 Apache .htaccess 信息泄露漏洞","description":"Cobalt RaQ 2.0 及 3.0 服务器中 Apache 的默认 access.conf 配置存在访问控制缺陷，导致远程攻击者无需认证即可直接读取服务器上的 .htaccess 文件内容。该文件通常包含目录访问密码、IP 白名单等敏感配置信息，泄露后可被攻击者利用以绕过身份验证或获取进一步攻击所需情报。此漏洞影响 Cobalt RaQ 2.0 和 3.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0234"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-31T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:17Z","remediation":"修改 Apache 配置（access.conf 或 httpd.conf），在 `<Directory>` 块中添加 `<Files ~ \"^\\.ht\">\\n  Deny from all\\n</Files>` 阻止所有 .htaccess 文件被外部访问。如仍使用 Cobalt RaQ 官方支持的版本，安装最新安全补丁；该设备已停止支持，建议迁移至现代服务器平台。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1083","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/advisory.html?id=2150","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000330220757.28456.qmail%40securityfocus.com","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19828","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0234.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0234","https://github.com/GuangrenYu/WangYi/blob/7b722603e4edd5477bcf5e43a23d80ac3a43aaa5/poc_kb/custom/2000/CVE-2000-0234.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0234.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jfx2-2f7p-cpgv/GHSA-jfx2-2f7p-cpgv.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0234.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_152200_152300.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_001256.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d44be1ac-537b-440f-be4c-6ffce5169bf2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0212.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0212.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0212.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0261","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0261.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0302","title":"Microsoft Index Server 2.0 ASP 源代码泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft Index Server 2.0 存在 ASP 源码泄露漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，只需向 null.htw 页面的 CiWebHitsFile 参数中附加 %20（URL 编码的空格字符），即可绕过服务器对 ASP 文件的解析机制，直接获取 ASP 文件的原始源代码。该漏洞导致 Web 应用中的数据库连接字符串、业务逻辑等敏感信息暴露，影响运行 Microsoft Index Server 2.0 的 Windows NT 4.0 系统。攻击者无需特殊权限，仅通过 HTTP GET 请求即可利用，危害等级中等。Microsoft 已在安全公告 MS00-006 中发布补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0302"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-31T00:00:00Z","updated":"2000-03-31T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-006 提供的补丁，或升级至 Windows 2000 Service Pack 1 及以上版本。如无法升级，可在 IIS 管理器中移除 .ida/.idq 脚本映射作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19830","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2000/CVE-2000-0302.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/34b929f9979d6d9d9584dfab31f29f50dcf08e3f/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0302.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0302","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4591185d8ea1fe47b6e30df3286bd52753a931ce/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0302.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2000/CVE-2000-0302.md","https://github.com/swimlane/soc-faker/blob/361c4ae88956878fbd8aaf5975044328556dfecd/socfaker/data/alert_names.txt","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e6b10ee602769bd7be4675bf10e3382c1f100e32/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-44jg-32fw-4mwj/GHSA-44jg-32fw-4mwj.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/ms_index_server.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0302.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/iis_anything_idq.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0261.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0223","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0223.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0246","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 UNC 映射虚拟主机信息泄露漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 及 5.0 版本在处理映射到 UNC 共享的虚拟目录时存在源码泄露漏洞。当管理员将虚拟目录映射至远程 UNC 共享路径后，ISAPI 扩展处理逻辑未能正确执行，导致远程攻击者可通过构造特制 HTTP 请求绕过脚本执行权限检查，直接读取 ASP 文件及其他受保护文件的源代码。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞获取敏感信息，如数据库连接字符串、应用逻辑代码等，为进一步渗透奠定基础。该漏洞影响 IIS 4.0 及 5.0 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0246"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-03-30T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:51:18Z","remediation":"建议安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS00-030 对应补丁（Q262694），或升级至 IIS 6.0 及以上版本。如无法升级，应避免将虚拟目录映射至 UNC 共享路径，改为使用本地目录；同时限制匿名用户对共享目录的访问权限，禁用 ASP 等脚本的 UNC 路径执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.microsoft.com/technet/support/kb.asp?ID=249599","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1081","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-019","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19824","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6b6ab35c79a8cf8624d21f1a20325bab41c1211a/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0246.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0246","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2000-0246.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0246.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2h2p-h37h-5phg/GHSA-2h2p-h37h-5phg.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/iis_unc_mapped_virt_host_vuln.nasl","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/invicti/vulnerabilities/db/vulnerabilities/vdb/2000/0